   Lions},
Abstract = {Nowadays, it is difficult to determine the veracity of the information
   obtained. Communication takes place through websites, discussions,
   social networks, and the like. Using various anti-social behavior tips,
   such as fake news, their disseminates want to gain various benefits or
   convince the recipient of ``their truth.{''} The theoretical part of the
   work is focused on different approaches to the detection of antisocial
   behavior. In the experimental part of this work, we will deal with the
   analysis of the statuses of opinion-forming dailies in the Slovak
   language, which we obtained from the social network Facebook. NLP
   message analysis is not accurate enough, and we create an algorithm that
   is better identifies POS tags.},
