   Univ; Conf Publishing Serv},
Abstract = {a new algorithm of detecting the violence behavior based on local
   spatio-temporal features and optical flow is introduced in this paper.
   It differs from the existing works of violence detection in what concern
   the data representation. Based on the physical contact detection
   algorithm which retains the frame containing possible violence, this
   paper combines Harris 3D spatio-temporal interest point detector and
   optical flow method to make up for defects of optical flow method in
   huge computation and slow processing. Experiments show that the proposed
   algorithm is of high to detect aggressive actions regardless of the
   context and number of human involved.},
